      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Beauty is subjective, but the *honesty* of that control is what will resonate. Readers who are tired of the relentless pressure will see a profound, if bleak, kind of elegance in his decision. It's not a triumphant beauty, but a quiet, undeniable symmetry—the ultimate act of self-determination when all other choices have proven meaningless.",
      "source": "target",
